        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4ac4083862a910e143b93a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっははー……",
      "source_fingerprint": "878e19d74569c5945d461ef122344ee24e37825db3c101a1c30f3c39a4dd04c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b2ff087dc01a48b2ead262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっははー……",
      "source_fingerprint": "878e19d74569c5945d461ef122344ee24e37825db3c101a1c30f3c39a4dd04c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234621617c2452d25e91841b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊──！！……好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d52f1d109f89b30119b26cd591bf79b2968fc293f11fab63d2036e96d00ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17525c36d4cbc1baf45b6f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要唱出感谢的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "088d15a35a84882c9ecc4202c753472c7200b827190360b8778da64db1af492b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd61c4f46564e6b4d359a61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为你的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad2694f26714be4cdd840ee53575dd070a260960f9d8321dd5b847fe9eb5fb10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ccba1ccfdcfae99c06791f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明明跑输模拟赛，你却还是\r\n相信我，愿意锻炼我……\r\n我想响应你的心意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58207e9d17b0530357b18ac2b1bfd97c423475e022ea00a864eb51c12e962fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac9e5bdf77a52aa4c073a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从参观学园后我就很向往这套制服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1829f49527cf4427f15f5dbe6529353054bbf223eb13b779bb59e54d619a9d40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2edd078f4bef12c4241d1f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不把表演跳成盆舞……\r\n舞蹈课我会努力练习的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c106ac112c3f5cb642b8428895c5220adbf62ba2764e6fcbec05229ab56a40a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1493ad7dd802f8328538ba08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿起来很方便运动，我很喜欢！\r\n似乎能直接穿去抬神轿呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "445d582142ddc347202c6b2e07f2f482bb4221c3ba47e09143e2d00eac7ec545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:988e0b0ff535426c27d1cd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近长高了……！\r\n裙子长度应该还够吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7c4d057af909256f89a17667ada8254ba5339c4d12aa97af0af64a0a1f147a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2503bfb77eb76449dbb35b52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在演唱会上唱歌时，\r\n我总觉得似乎能体会爸爸的心情了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a9641b176afa5a7fbffc131f36c88a8e84fd3990e415d8108406d9c986552f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:985c20880a5df27c32c019d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想以这套服装，\r\n像祭典上的烟火一样发光发热！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d91899ba65909a51da4acbc48269f353dfb8724af6af4297cd3e2c23be86f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc75c71abe44646d90e7f38a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是打破常识的\r\n新时代赛马娘巫女！",
      "source_fingerprint": "423efd7c901819f93d7a538b8e0d34eaaceff7ac65b922302c780ce1876abf52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af9e0ec776ae6d7d7a77248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜事就交给我吧！\r\n我会轻盈地展现优雅的舞蹈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e02e49fd577a6b051af0e8e9594ae5763a9300860e006148dbaf8763603e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:381746d6ac40df25b98c31b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "适合我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af315bbea3d1779b71f8a723d873c87b97803c9f32f37b88904ef1502b08fb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18b652d40b06eaf3bf01595b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea5ade675e98ee9bd383ee2c3ac0a0e26d04d670d5b2d4c31e4998e9e790123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab7214faa40064290b8e00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套衣服真的会感到很平静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeaf240e77ff5a3341bf58c51656fafd84096a319afa0fc98d3519249bcf9c73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e986d04852f0f6866c5f2c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使只是去附近散步也得好好\r\n打理服仪！这是我爸爸的教诲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46be366f926bb01ded23d578f159c317baf070884e4f980606d66d0177d7693b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6348e57e23906e6e9a0c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "応援してくれるみんなの想い…\r\nあたしが背負います！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b085bef538dae98627a79a8c6f7ca4538cce0ca44671ebe0070066b276d5555b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47efe228da7fe8f982fda935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この肩章、もふもふで\r\n柔らかいんですよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba65bd505a15ddd60271dfe252ad083563c71d16d8a4807e29096f5fbbd34642",
