      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0fcac5180dde021500aa860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恥じない努力を重ねてきました！\r\nさあ、真っ向勝負っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcb70f34973fee86e83292d8768ccc625fbd2c4a5674dc7cccb607e8c95a665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2266cc91f918a6058a6b296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ええい、勝負はこれからっ！\r\nお祭り娘の根性、お見せします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0c7b2a348d9e060f711a2ae432c3dfa26869055333e090045fb270f1880731",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f768d685be3c5c9a5d4b266",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安啊！\r\n嘿嘿，我常常被称赞\r\n打招呼时很有精神喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed73b79ab050b5eff0b3b595b05c548bb0dabdc99bfab6731eeb18cea808522",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b2c4374afd3047d0b9e614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常帮助有困扰的人，\r\n有时会因此差点迟到……\r\n是否该再提早三十分钟起床呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b5ae2cfcf7cfafce9264e35c6d72e7c4ce6484a5c40360d95a6334d73a234d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da4111ed736d528861995cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，已经中午了呢！\r\n该去「热心助人」\r\n帮忙朋友解决问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82887d405b3206801488bbfb9db19b7eec83930a0dbfc75a24f7b1db638f130b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a923bb242e8b8dcdb7460bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下课后我要跟班上同学们\r\n一起去玩！交给我炒热气氛啰～\r\n嘿呀，嘿呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b6b7bd71123004fdf22f55f3942b325017a507417e85936cd128257dfcbf7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d086ce8f08d9e591d5e2b78a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的浴室回声很大，\r\n害我总忍不住想高歌～\r\n有时候还会大家一起合唱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a22ad02ac43381f1ed397d1c4d3d060fa4b93c0312cca7b4a1018bd8eb4f8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fccb900441da8ddd5f939cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算对体力有信心，但晚上还是要\r\n乖乖睡觉喔！我有时候也会\r\n害小钻为我担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb3c56d1605ab1de9e40589d243cfdec18e0a413fade1e1695093502712b34aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a5ccf0cc0e58ccf4f9e196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就会想到樱花呢！既壮观\r\n又不留恋地凋谢……不过我最喜欢的\r\n还是大家都会露出笑容这点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dfa1b38bf042e6e13089c9d77aa39057a934b3021d05393a679b7c3abd51234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88f44ed1cebb9a786eef35c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿呀！喝啊！嘿呀！\r\n……你问我在做什么？\r\n下次我要跟稻荷一起抬神轿喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b70c28bb8beab447046bdbba8bbda747a81b71837e47bbc2e8832cba3e32939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d774d673f35f72c7eafe7e3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天已经尽情游了泳，所以我在想\r\n下次去爬山好像也不错。\r\n带上巨大的饭团，约大家一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c357833f76ed7072738c557f9347da8db153f58b69236d1af816ed3825848eaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a77e518c4ea3a341e35d554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气冷害得你身体僵硬吗？\r\n我来教你妈妈亲自传授的按摩术吧，\r\n这样就能防止受伤啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "634e947e534c245d6ed20b5709481054d44f9853fd02fee7d401a3de590bc194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eca7362059491394fb3949e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近开始会上杂志，所以一大早\r\n就会被粉丝包围，虽然很开心……\r\n但我也希望能有时间跟小钻说话啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "019543fc558f34b1607bdb139139e2d801519e11973a80dd1478b8da6e09eb8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac6145df9615419e7fb771e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天早起，用抹布把宿舍走廊的\r\n地板擦干净了！真怀念以前和\r\n弟子们一起热闹打扫的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d36981d0cb28108b1b87259a583bea13640571d700a1b2db0dfc92d6affa6647",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053e3c8a2c24ea8abf3201c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来对打陀螺很有自信的……\r\n没想到草上飞那么厉害！\r\n好～休息时间来特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b405226911ecbc197ed58cb2c3aea0ea7010194e479ae2fd5fca66a6e642761",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4b11b84f954c76fad735f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮忙过祭神仪式后，\r\n就觉得历史课变得比以前有趣了！\r\n意志会持续流传，真是浪漫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3390fd3d9663bcb2468b820b2ecaeb210c86fc6b10ac705882cfc205424a0bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b6a898062cf4f16f5c4035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说以前的赛马娘巫女会禁食，\r\n那样真的没问题吗？\r\n我应该无法忍受不吃晚餐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "494bdc58aa2049f5007f4e92013ec9f9962b9ede5fcc8734c35fe0ba9b476713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f629650b31fe86b8251cb8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小心火烛！参加祭神仪式时，\r\n我再次体会到火的强大与可怕。\r\n我去巡一下火源！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46fc18eb2578297a57c03164dff57bda04595b546348ca0e92e2d2e3cc5a6cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1474281de0c122c7339ad7c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把健行的说明事项\r\n发给新生们了！学园后山的\r\n风景很棒，大家一定会很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23194899d54c51e88ed375999dd487bf56d9e303f71c662325eca16e29461ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e070e2988cd73e521f3b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服毛茸茸的部分底下\r\n变得能放保冷剂了！\r\n是很棒的改良呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e2c0b52f05a1538866e510508b4a7b6b1d4a5bbcd9d8a2be09074dfd042752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6cf99fdea3d603f0d73dd2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待去山上采收柿子。\r\n今年一定要和黄金船一起\r\n迭出一百层的柿子塔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0372fc1c4f45217e0df5c10b1fd3cec753c6865403a9554edb1c06013cb9db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dc20d4752bf28aa09a4e268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起生篝火吗？\r\n火焰不只能够取暖，\r\n还能驱除不好的东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "215f678ba0fd329ed4af67f18094c9cf39767a3837e7cd9239cb671f3c1bec4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3e66bc604f14969c8b5f7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38d1deb2a7a801a79c8405c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a06ea578955bd9366320db0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一天从问候开始！为了能\r\n成为让大家都喜欢的明星\r\n…还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efaa180ff11c1edb499dc458677b976d0a1b56aa1a35f5d37946c4563522e51a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4e43d8243f4f6c5d5a0854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的胜利女神～♪…\r\n啊，要一起来做发声练习吗？\r\n从早上开始能让头脑很快清醒过来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c31a6f5d028656fd7b942c8b78abedb7d12475d83136c843b116a1fb7f9536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec404bb7a3e29b2cc3ce0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落雁、和三盆、琥珀糖♪\r\n说吧！今天的零食\r\n要吃哪种日式糕点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75a6f655648f0b4e29611471745293651eda14bf7be96e6646b47d39ccfeb922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8605a0ebe2949c4e1ba9a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀！就算再忙 也不能忘记\r\n吃午饭的哦？对于我来说\r\n吃胡萝卜饭可以让我精神百倍♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "072611dcaa49c810005735a54f1db283d12d781812d708abe66aa22c38fab5e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad8fe7cef1e8d0db15a6187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摇啊摇啊～快睡吧～♪…诶嘿嘿、\r\n我唱摇篮曲很拿手的！说不定\r\n我也能让训练员你睡个好觉哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8ede3663e396cedcb46d164c91d01feca143ee1098ea291ca74bd869226362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9a4eae6faa90905877db9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看！外面的月亮，\r\n就和舞台上的聚光灯一样…这时要是\r\n一起跳舞 说不定会有当演员的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ff05135b75185942fda433b73b11210edd577fa90aabc5ea27df02d25c8902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3eca6c6f445ded4da2fd5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想和大家一起看鲤鱼旗呀。\r\n爸爸妈妈，弟子们和小钻，\r\n还有训练员！真是个大家族呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f90b0d6d22454daf4814984e43d952af1f8e90b43f24e333c78248358549232",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45160c24200d9285b7843049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来，有试胆大会的活动…\r\n但、但是也有温柔的幽灵对吧！\r\n要是一起唱歌的话说不定能成为朋友…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db907a873a8f297c5e11a7cef312642dcfc4c01ea7955a69da89bc11f9f0a265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bbda9f21ea2b25701386a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身决胜服，和鲜红的枫叶\r\n简直一模一样！说不定能通过我\r\n来赏枫呢…开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b937d458e4d84507e9e173c2e4b960b1ba0430acafeb77d485c54f12f29d6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00842bf9b8049e4e3a5534b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灯彩装饰真漂亮啊！\r\n大家就像过祭典一样洋溢着幸福…\r\n连寒冷都能一扫而空呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa455ed4f8178532e645ae439184e145500d93600e3f8715063917a12e72b12e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad6834d003d0ec078e04acb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41cf6a91760b375b76d48376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次那场比赛……实在太精彩了……\r\n我现在还上不了台面，但总有一天\r\n我一定要像帝王一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4f71bb0968fcc8d68204fa8edbcbd398dea00b4428191438520d9ec3e4e19d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
